<title>DENMARK: POLL - Copenhagen Airports H1 profit seen up.</title>
<headline>POLL - Copenhagen Airports H1 profit seen up.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five analysts polled by Reuters in a survey published on Tuesday predicted that Copenhagen Airports will post average pre-tax profits for 1997's first six months 10.4 percent up on the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>The panel foresaw pre-tax interim profits at 220 million crowns compared to 199 million crowns a year ago, on 9.3 percent higher 743 million crown turnover.</p>
<p>COPENHAGEN AIRPORTS FIRST-HALF 1997 RESULT FORECAST TABLE (five analysts, figures in million crowns)</p>
<p>			  average    high/low  H1 1996</p>
<p>Turnover		  743	764/717	680</p>
<p>Pre-tax result	  220	228/206	199</p>
<p>Net profit		144	150/136	131</p>
<p>--Joern Nurkka, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969655</p>
